/* kb.c to parse boolean expressions  -*-update-version-*-
** HFVR VERSION=Wed Jan  7 07:51:33 1987
**
** SYNTAX accepted:
** ------ ---------
** <query> ::= <term> { OR <term> }*
**
** <term> ::= <factor> { AND <factor> }*
**
** <factor> ::=   <key>
** 	        | NOT <factor>
**	        | ( <query> )
**
** <key> ::= <anything except ( ) ! & | SP TAB \n \0 > and or not ~
**
** alternative syntax for some keywords:
** -----------
** NOT		!	~ 	not
** AND		&	&&	and
** OR		|	||	or
** (		[	{	<
